+From ce11c6a8523ad72fe6f6c02e61ff63564f6b1e3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: "4830.org Admins" <wusel+src@uu.org>
+Date: Wed, 7 Jan 2026 14:06:15 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH 1/1] scripts/dtc/pylibfdt/libfdt.i_shipped: Use
